    "The following table covers every supplied variable, including those used in the research questions. Numeric storage does not determine semantic type. Gender uses the source's two recorded labels; the coding does not establish how sex or gender was collected. Ethnicity labels are reproduced from the dictionary. Education has an order but the distances between categories are not numerical measurements. There are no date/time variables.\n",
