   "source": [
    "## 5. Selected exploratory patterns\n",
    "\n",
    "Figure 1 checks the distributions of age, cognitive score, daily-function score and activity. Figure 2 shows diagnosis balance. Later figures answer the three replacement questions directly. The age histogram uses one-year bins to avoid an apparent spike caused by uneven bin membership for integer ages. Means, medians, standard deviations and quartiles appear in the tables, avoiding repeated plots of every variable.\n"
   ]
